WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:11.310
Welcome to SOS Crew, the volunteer signup for the Edgewood Showcase of Spins. Every band, guard and percussion family works shifts, and it all starts here.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.465
The quickest way in is Sign in with Google.

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:22.303
Or enter your email and tap Continue. We'll email you a sign-in link. If you're new, the same box gets your family set up.

00:00:22.503 --> 00:00:26.950
Have a family code from an email? Open this, and type it in.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:35.971
New? You'll see this form. Your email is filled in. Add your name, and your cell phone, so your point person can text you on contest day.

00:00:36.171 --> 00:00:42.380
Then add each student in the program, with their group. If a student has their own cell phone, add it too.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.880
More than one student? Tap Another student.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:50.443
Students can set themselves up too. Check I am a current student,

00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:53.993
and pick your group. Students are exempt from background checks.

00:00:54.193 --> 00:00:58.510
You can add a parent here, so they can sign in to the same family.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:07.520
Tap Create my family. With Google you're in right away. With email, watch your inbox for the sign-in link, and check spam.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:13.939
This is your family page. Bookmark it, or keep the email; the link signs you right back in.

00:01:14.139 --> 00:01:19.610
What your family owes is at the top. The next parts of this series walk through the rest.

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:24.310
Next, in part two: finding a shift and signing up.
